336
00:27:26,080 --> 00:27:27,600
<font color="#ffffff">Anyway,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:30,840
<font color="#ffffff">since you can see each other now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:32,880
<font color="#ffffff">it means your fates are linked.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:36,920
<font color="#ffffff">From now on, there's no need to fear him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

340
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:40,280
<font color="#ffffff">He's just a harmless little ghost.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

341
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:44,360
<font color="#ffffff">But a ghost is a ghost!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:47,200
<font color="#ffffff">Even if he's harmless,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:27:47,280 --> 00:27:48,960
<font color="#ffffff">it's still terrifying!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:27:49,040 --> 00:27:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">When you couldn't see me before,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you weren't scared at all!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

345
00:27:54,800 --> 00:27:56,880
<font color="#ffffff">He makes a good point.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:27:57,480 --> 00:28:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">When you couldn't see him,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you felt nothing.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

347
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:03,560
<font color="#ffffff">Now that you can see him,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">why start freaking out?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

348
00:28:05,360 --> 00:28:06,800
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be afraid!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:09,480
<font color="#ffffff">Even though I'm a ghost,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'm a very adorable one!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

350
00:28:10,600 --> 00:28:12,320
<font color="#ffffff">Oh… Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:16,920
<font color="#ffffff">Why can I suddenly see him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:28:17,840 --> 00:28:19,400
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">No one has ever been able</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to see me before except for you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

354
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">He is the very first one!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:51,280
<font color="#ffffff">Ya?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:28:51,360 --> 00:28:53,800
<font color="#ffffff">KAN KARUNAWAD</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

357
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:55,160
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,720
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

359
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:01,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm already in Bangkok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:29:02,760 --> 00:29:04,160
<font color="#ffffff">Let's meet tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:29:09,920 --> 00:29:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">Why does she want to see me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:29:13,520 --> 00:29:14,440
<font color="#ffffff">Kan…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

363
00:29:14,520 --> 00:29:15,360
<font color="#ffffff">6 YEARS AGO</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

364
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:17,760
<font color="#ffffff">Do you really believe Padej</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">stole that diamond?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

365
00:29:17,840 --> 00:29:22,040
<font color="#ffffff">The detectives say</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the evidence against him<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

366
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">is pretty solid.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:26,840
<font color="#ffffff">But I don't believe he'd do such a thing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:29:27,400 --> 00:29:28,920
<font color="#ffffff">He saved my life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:33,760
<font color="#ffffff">Don't mix his past good deeds</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with the facts of the case today.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

370
00:29:34,360 --> 00:29:37,840
<font color="#ffffff">I know how to separate</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">my personal feelings from my job.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

371
00:29:46,240 --> 00:29:48,920
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant, take over for a second.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'll be right back.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

372
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:29:58,160 --> 00:29:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'm here to eat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">You're tailing Kamnan again?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">Who do you think you are to kick me out?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Move aside.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

376
00:30:11,080 --> 00:30:12,320
<font color="#ffffff">You can't go inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:14,600
<font color="#ffffff">Back off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:15,960
<font color="#ffffff">You back off!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:30:16,040 --> 00:30:16,960
<font color="#ffffff">Ya!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:20,520
<font color="#ffffff">Kan!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:27,800
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Ya!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:30:33,160 --> 00:30:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">Ya!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:30:35,040 --> 00:30:37,000
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you running away from me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:30:37,080 --> 00:30:38,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

385
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:40,760
<font color="#ffffff">I just don't want to talk to you anymore.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

386
00:30:40,840 --> 00:30:43,400
<font color="#ffffff">Did I really do something that terrible?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:30:46,560 --> 00:30:47,520
<font color="#ffffff">And…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:30:48,080 --> 00:30:49,680
<font color="#ffffff">Since when did you move here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

389
00:30:50,800 --> 00:30:52,520
<font color="#ffffff">None of your business.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

390
00:30:52,600 --> 00:30:55,120
<font color="#ffffff">We aren't together anymore, remember?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">Sawaeng and his people</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">have too much power.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

392
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:02,320
<font color="#ffffff">Stay away from them. It's too dangerous.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:31:02,920 --> 00:31:05,720
<font color="#ffffff">Mind your own business, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:31:06,400 --> 00:31:08,800
<font color="#ffffff">Aren't you here to work on</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond case too?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

395
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:12,160
<font color="#ffffff">Let's just stick to our own duties.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:14,040
<font color="#ffffff">We have nothing to do with each other.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:17,720
<font color="#ffffff">Don't interfere with my reporting</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">like you did before.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

398
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">Are you still angry with me about that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:31:56,360 --> 00:31:57,360
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Luang Pho.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:31:57,440 --> 00:32:01,800
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Why can I suddenly see him?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:03,200
<font color="#ffffff"><i>That's right.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:32:03,280 --> 00:32:07,360
<font color="#ffffff"><i>No one has ever been able</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>to see me before except for you.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

403
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:09,880
<font color="#ffffff"><i>He is the very first one!</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">As for the reason why…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:40,120
<font color="#ffffff">You know the drill, Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:43,760
<font color="#ffffff">If you cooperate, I'll go easier on you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

407
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">I told you the whole truth.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:53,560
<font color="#ffffff">How can I confess</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to something I didn't do?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

409
00:32:54,560 --> 00:32:56,120
<font color="#ffffff">You won't confess, will you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:32:57,640 --> 00:32:59,280
<font color="#ffffff">That's enough for today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

411
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Captain!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">Please. I beg you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

413
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Let me out on bail for just a few days.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,680
<font color="#ffffff">It's just…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">I have a nephew,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:25,760
<font color="#ffffff">and he's sick.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:33:26,520 --> 00:33:28,480
<font color="#ffffff">I just need to check on him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:33:30,040 --> 00:33:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">I've been away for days.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:33:32,560 --> 00:33:35,440
<font color="#ffffff">Let me check on him,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and if he's all right,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

420
00:33:36,120 --> 00:33:39,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'll return and let you question me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for as long as you want.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

421
00:33:40,880 --> 00:33:42,800
<font color="#ffffff">Where are his parents?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

422
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,360
<font color="#ffffff">He's an orphan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:49,360
<font color="#ffffff">They are gone.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He has no other relatives, except me.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

424
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:51,640
<font color="#ffffff">Please trust me, okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

425
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:53,880
<font color="#ffffff">Just let me go take care of him first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:33:55,520 --> 00:33:56,520
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

427
00:33:57,640 --> 00:33:59,960
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon denied your bail.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:34:01,280 --> 00:34:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:03,440
<font color="#ffffff">And…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:34:04,760 --> 00:34:06,600
<font color="#ffffff">What about my nephew?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

431
00:34:11,600 --> 00:34:12,880
<font color="#ffffff">Where is he?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:34:13,560 --> 00:34:14,719
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go check on him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:34:25,080 --> 00:34:27,280
<font color="#ffffff">I have a bad feeling about this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:34:28,239 --> 00:34:29,639
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

435
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:32,000
<font color="#ffffff">please be okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:34:32,679 --> 00:34:34,800
<font color="#ffffff">You have to stay strong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

437
00:34:41,560 --> 00:34:42,639
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:34:44,120 --> 00:34:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">Captain!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:50,639
<font color="#ffffff">Captain…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:34:51,280 --> 00:34:53,400
<font color="#ffffff">How is my nephew, Tofu?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:34:56,040 --> 00:34:57,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so sorry, Sergeant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:35:03,240 --> 00:35:04,440
<font color="#ffffff">Captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:35:05,520 --> 00:35:06,600
<font color="#ffffff">Captain…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:12,640
<font color="#ffffff">Is he dead?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

445
00:35:21,760 --> 00:35:23,240
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:35:38,480 --> 00:35:40,240
<font color="#ffffff">My poor Tofu!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

447
00:36:23,440 --> 00:36:25,160
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:28,240
<font color="#ffffff">You need to wake up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

449
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:33,240
<font color="#ffffff">The sun is setting.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You shouldn't be sleeping.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

450
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">If you nap too much,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

451
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:40,480
<font color="#ffffff">you won't sleep tonight,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and you'll end up bothering me again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

452
00:36:42,920 --> 00:36:44,680
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu, why…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:36:52,080 --> 00:36:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

454
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:55,880
<font color="#ffffff">please stay strong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:36:55,960 --> 00:36:57,520
<font color="#ffffff">He is at peace now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:09,320
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu, why didn't you wait for me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

457
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:12,480
<font color="#ffffff">Why…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:37:17,360 --> 00:37:19,680
<font color="#ffffff">Why?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:37:46,160 --> 00:37:49,800
<font color="#ffffff">It is a karmic bond, made in ignorance,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:37:49,880 --> 00:37:52,880
<font color="#ffffff">that brought the two of you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">together at last.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

461
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">Not here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:39:21,640 --> 00:39:22,840
<font color="#ffffff">Not there either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

463
00:39:36,040 --> 00:39:37,280
<font color="#ffffff">Not here too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:39:41,520 --> 00:39:43,000
<font color="#ffffff">Not here either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

465
00:39:51,160 --> 00:39:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's not in his bag.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:39:52,720 --> 00:39:55,480
<font color="#ffffff">Is it possible he doesn't even have it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

467
00:39:59,600 --> 00:40:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">Are you still afraid of me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

469
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:07,840
<font color="#ffffff">You startled me!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You can't just sneak up like that.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

470
00:40:07,920 --> 00:40:11,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'm a ghost. I can't just knock</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on the door before entering.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

471
00:40:11,960 --> 00:40:15,400
<font color="#ffffff">I know. I'm just venting.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:40:15,480 --> 00:40:17,400
<font color="#ffffff">So, what are you looking for?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:21,560
<font color="#ffffff">Nothing. I'm just tidying up</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

474
00:40:22,200 --> 00:40:25,280
<font color="#ffffff">Really? Lying in a temple</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is a heavy sin, you know.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

475
00:40:28,960 --> 00:40:30,240
<font color="#ffffff">Fine, I'll stop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:40:42,120 --> 00:40:43,960
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you going, junior disciple?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

477
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:47,240
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, kid.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:40:49,560 --> 00:40:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">Why do you call me that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:55,600
<font color="#ffffff">Well, you became Luang Pho's</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">follower after me,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

480
00:40:55,680 --> 00:40:57,480
<font color="#ffffff">so that makes you my junior disciple!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:40:59,040 --> 00:41:03,520
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Wait, Tofu might actually know</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>where Luang Pho keeps the diamond.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

482
00:41:04,400 --> 00:41:05,280
<font color="#ffffff">Senior!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:41:05,360 --> 00:41:08,000
<font color="#ffffff">You're finally calling me "senior"?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, whatever makes you happy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

485
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:14,320
<font color="#ffffff">Senior,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:41:15,080 --> 00:41:16,360
<font color="#ffffff">can I ask a question?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

487
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">Sure. Just ask away!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:41:18,560 --> 00:41:20,000
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, so</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

489
00:41:20,080 --> 00:41:22,520
<font color="#ffffff">you've been with Luang Pho</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">all the time, right?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

490
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, my whole life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

491
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

492
00:41:27,640 --> 00:41:29,680
<font color="#ffffff">Then have you ever seen something</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:41:29,760 --> 00:41:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">like a small, shiny, beautiful pink rock</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that he keeps?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

494
00:41:33,120 --> 00:41:33,960
<font color="#ffffff">Have you seen it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

495
00:41:34,040 --> 00:41:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">A shiny, beautiful pink rock?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:41:41,560 --> 00:41:43,400
<font color="#ffffff">-Oh! Yes, I have!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yeah!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

497
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:46,520
<font color="#ffffff">It was when the lady at the dessert shop</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:41:46,600 --> 00:41:50,920
<font color="#ffffff">offered Luang Pho lychee juice</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">over crushed ice. It looked so pretty!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

499
00:41:51,520 --> 00:41:52,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's not food.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:41:53,040 --> 00:41:54,680
<font color="#ffffff">Strawberry bubblegum!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:41:54,760 --> 00:41:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">When you bite it, it gleams so brightly!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

502
00:41:58,160 --> 00:42:00,600
<font color="#ffffff">It's not food, and it's not bubblegum!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

503
00:42:00,680 --> 00:42:03,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's something incredibly valuable</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that everyone wants. You know?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

504
00:42:04,040 --> 00:42:05,520
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

505
00:42:05,600 --> 00:42:08,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Be more specific next time. I've seen it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

506
00:42:08,280 --> 00:42:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">It's some glowing pink slime</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">a student played with in the temple.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

507
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:30,600
<font color="#ffffff">Just go away!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

508
00:42:30,680 --> 00:42:33,680
<font color="#ffffff">What is wrong with him?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Talking to himself.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

509
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:35,880
<font color="#ffffff">Did he hurt his head?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

510
00:42:36,800 --> 00:42:38,680
<font color="#ffffff">What a waste of time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

511
00:42:39,280 --> 00:42:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">Not that? I wanted that slime so badly!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

512
00:42:52,360 --> 00:42:53,680
<font color="#ffffff">That lady is here again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

513
00:42:58,040 --> 00:42:59,520
<font color="#ffffff">Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

514
00:43:01,080 --> 00:43:02,200
<font color="#ffffff">Darat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

515
00:43:02,280 --> 00:43:04,880
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing out here</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">all by yourself?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

516
00:43:04,960 --> 00:43:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">She sticks to him like glue.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

517
00:43:07,880 --> 00:43:09,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just getting some fresh air.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

518
00:43:11,480 --> 00:43:14,720
<font color="#ffffff">So, did you find it?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Is it with Luang Pho Suea?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

519
00:43:18,320 --> 00:43:19,760
<font color="#ffffff">Is something wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

520
00:43:21,480 --> 00:43:23,240
<font color="#ffffff">I came to check on this matter.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

521
00:43:23,320 --> 00:43:26,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'm certain he has it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

522
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:29,680
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise, why would he arrange</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for Paul to intercept you?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

523
00:43:31,800 --> 00:43:34,120
<font color="#ffffff">He's so wicked. What kind of monk is he?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

524
00:43:34,200 --> 00:43:36,920
<font color="#ffffff">He claims to renounce the world,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">yet he is still so greedy?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

525
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:40,640
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! How dare you insult Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

526
00:43:43,000 --> 00:43:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">What's happening?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

527
00:43:44,480 --> 00:43:45,520
<font color="#ffffff">Darat?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

528
00:43:49,600 --> 00:43:51,600
<font color="#ffffff">Senior, please, stop it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

529
00:43:51,680 --> 00:43:53,720
<font color="#ffffff">Fine, for your sake.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

530
00:43:53,800 --> 00:43:56,120
<font color="#ffffff">Why did the wind blow so hard</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">all of a sudden?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

531
00:43:58,080 --> 00:44:01,400
<font color="#ffffff">Serves you right!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you dare insult Luang Pho again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

532
00:44:06,440 --> 00:44:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">Darat, we should leave.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

533
00:44:09,080 --> 00:44:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">The spirits here are aggressive.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

534
00:44:13,680 --> 00:44:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">I mean, the wind is too strong. Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

535
00:44:15,960 --> 00:44:17,000
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

536
00:44:17,080 --> 00:44:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh my!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

537
00:44:18,920 --> 00:44:20,240
<font color="#ffffff">Don't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

538
00:44:29,160 --> 00:44:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">That crazy wind completely ruined my hair!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

539
00:44:37,400 --> 00:44:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">Are you all right, Chan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

540
00:44:41,360 --> 00:44:43,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

541
00:44:44,320 --> 00:44:47,440
<font color="#ffffff">Right. Did you manage to find the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

542
00:44:50,880 --> 00:44:54,360
<font color="#ffffff">I searched all his things,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">but found nothing.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

543
00:44:55,600 --> 00:44:59,320
<font color="#ffffff">Then he must be keeping it</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on him at all times.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

544
00:45:00,720 --> 00:45:02,840
<font color="#ffffff">But what if it was dropped along the way?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

545
00:45:03,440 --> 00:45:06,640
<font color="#ffffff">Is it possible the diamond</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">really isn't with Luang Pho?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

546
00:45:07,960 --> 00:45:10,720
<font color="#ffffff">Why do you trust Luang Pho Suea so much?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

547
00:45:14,760 --> 00:45:15,960
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you asking me that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

548
00:45:16,840 --> 00:45:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

549
00:45:18,800 --> 00:45:20,600
<font color="#ffffff">Because it feels like</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

550
00:45:20,680 --> 00:45:24,680
<font color="#ffffff">you're trying to find excuses</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to clear him of suspicion.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

551
00:45:31,360 --> 00:45:35,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't mix his past good deeds</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with the facts of this case.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

552
00:45:35,640 --> 00:45:38,680
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise, your reporting will be led</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">by your heart, not your head.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

553
00:45:38,760 --> 00:45:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">Isn't that a bit harsh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

554
00:45:40,080 --> 00:45:43,120
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

555
00:45:43,200 --> 00:45:46,200
<font color="#ffffff">I think it must be just as I thought.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

556
00:45:46,800 --> 00:45:48,000
<font color="#ffffff">-Ms. Yok!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Ms. Yok!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

557
00:45:48,080 --> 00:45:49,160
<font color="#ffffff">Right, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

558
00:45:51,640 --> 00:45:53,320
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong with him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

559
00:45:53,400 --> 00:45:55,920
<font color="#ffffff">Ever since he went</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with that bubblegum lady,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

560
00:45:56,000 --> 00:45:57,720
<font color="#ffffff">he has been acting like this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

561
00:45:59,240 --> 00:46:00,480
<font color="#ffffff">Here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

562
00:46:00,560 --> 00:46:02,760
<font color="#ffffff">It's necessary to have a phone these days.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

563
00:46:02,840 --> 00:46:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">Save my number, and we can get in touch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

564
00:46:05,200 --> 00:46:06,760
<font color="#ffffff">Is this my house?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

565
00:46:07,360 --> 00:46:09,640
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't you want to learn more</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">about yourself?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

566
00:46:09,720 --> 00:46:11,760
<font color="#ffffff">This is the best way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

567
00:46:11,840 --> 00:46:13,480
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

568
00:46:13,560 --> 00:46:14,480
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

569
00:46:16,480 --> 00:46:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">Is this who you really are?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

570
00:46:22,240 --> 00:46:24,040
<font color="#ffffff">-What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Junior!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

571
00:46:24,120 --> 00:46:25,640
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

572
00:46:25,720 --> 00:46:27,400
<font color="#ffffff">-Junior!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Boonrod!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

573
00:46:28,040 --> 00:46:29,280
<font color="#ffffff">Let's head home.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

574
00:46:29,360 --> 00:46:30,960
<font color="#ffffff">Where's your home? I'll walk you there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

575
00:46:31,040 --> 00:46:32,520
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh, there's no need.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

576
00:46:33,920 --> 00:46:36,720
